  "worked_solution": "We apply the multiplicative property of double integrals, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\u222c}_{R}\\sqrt{xy}\\text{\u00a0}\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\u222c}_{R}{x}^{1/2}\\,{y}^{1/2}\\,{y}^{-1}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\u222c}_{R}({x}^{1/2})\\text{\u00a0}({y}^{-1/2})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =({\\int }_{0}^{5}\\sqrt{x}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{3}^{7}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{y}}\\,\\text{d}y)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
